                <span class="section-badge">Deals Platform Case Study</span>
                <h1 class="case-study-title">MerchantDeals Promotional Offers Platform for Campaign Launches and Merchant Operations</h1>
                <p class="hero-lead">Built a merchant promotions system that gave retailers a better way to launch offers, manage discount campaigns, and measure engagement from one dashboard.</p>
