                  <div class="meta-pill"><i class="bi bi-person-workspace"></i><span><strong>Role:</strong> Senior Full-Stack Engineer</span></div>
                  <div class="meta-pill"><i class="bi bi-calendar3"></i><span><strong>Timeline:</strong> 10 weeks</span></div>
                  <div class="meta-pill"><i class="bi bi-people"></i><span><strong>Team:</strong> 1 PM, 1 engineer</span></div>
                  <div class="meta-pill"><i class="bi bi-layers"></i><span><strong>Stack:</strong> Laravel, Blade, Bootstrap, MySQL</span></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-5">
              <div class="hero-visual" data-aos="fade-left" data-aos-delay="220">
                <div class="project-media">
                  <img src="/assets/img/projects/merchantdeals/feature.webp" alt="MerchantDeals Promotional Offers Platform for Campaign Launches and Merchant Operations main project preview" width="1600" height="1000" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" />
                </div>
                <div class="floating-card card-primary">
                  <span class="eyebrow">Retail Campaigns</span>
                  <strong>Merchant promotion workflows were standardized into a repeatable digital operations layer.</strong>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
