              <h3>Merchant Dashboard</h3>
              <p>Centralized offers and performance into a merchant-friendly admin surface.</p>
              <span>Made routine use more practical.</span>
            </article>
            <article class="service-card">
              <i class="bi bi-gear-wide-connected"></i>
              <h3>Structured Campaign Operations</h3>
              <p>Turned promotional work into a more repeatable digital process.</p>
              <span>Created a stronger operational base for growth.</span>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
